id: pm-gantt-chart-maint1014
title: Enable the gated GitHub issue sync and drop the braces chain
description: Enable the SHA-pinned fail-closed issue sync caller and remove fast-glob by adopting published pm-ops 2026.10.14. Keep existing thresholds and verify isolated npm and Bun release gates. This combined maintenance chore implements the dependency remediation tracked by pm-gantt-chart-e7rd and leaves that issue open for verification.
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-14T09:25:44.857Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-14T09:56:01.295Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-14T09:25:51.819Z",codex-agent,"Plan: author this package own thin workflow caller at 17 1 * * *, pin the workflow SHA and pm-github package to 2026.10.13, remove fast-glob and any jscpd4 alias, and pin pm-ops 2026.10.14. Published changelog reviewed: stricter attestation rejects unresolved aliases/functions, prepare is read-only during pack, release completeness repair and Windows proof support changed. Canonical duplication now uses Node glob and jscpd 5; existing local launcher needs no edits. No workflow dispatch, bot requests, or merges."
  "2026-10-14T09:27:06.765Z",codex-agent,"Audit before: full 4 vulnerabilities (4 high), production 0. After: full 0, production 0; npm ls braces is empty. The caller runs at 17 1 * * * UTC. It validates access, previews the complete plan, imports with --gate, verifies repeat-import idempotency and privacy, then checks strict health before commit/push/PR. SHA pin matches published pm-github 2026.10.13. Actionlint skipped: binary missing and offline npx registry metadata unavailable. GitHub Actions PR-creation setting verified enabled. No direct fast-glob imports in authored scripts; no runtime function change or behavioural revert test applies."
  "2026-10-14T09:39:29.455Z",codex-agent,"Initial npm and Bun gates each passed 242/243 tests and failed the canonical prepare-template equality check. Adapted this package own launcher to the published artifact-time prepare contract without copying any other repo file. Added a behavioural regression covering pack/publish with pinned and stale installers: exit 0, one skip notice and byte-identical Git config. Focused regression passes 1/1; restoring only the old launcher fails it, then fixed launcher restored. Full gates will be rerun."
  "2026-10-14T09:55:54.237Z",codex-agent,"Validation complete: npm: 244/244 tests passed, 0 skipped; bun: 244/244 tests passed, 0 skipped. Both isolated release:check gates passed at unchanged thresholds. Full audit 0, production audit 0, npm ls braces empty. Caller identity check reports only unbraind/pm-github. Behavioural revert proof: artifact-prepare regression passes 1/1 and fails when only the previous launcher is restored. Changelog regenerated and checked. Actionlint unavailable offline as recorded above. Item stays in progress for orchestrator verification."
